{
  "id": 8860456026311,
  "title": "Personalized Teal Argyle Reading Girl with Books Throw Blanket - Book",
  "handle": "personalized-teal-argyle-reading-girl-with-books-throw-blanket-book",
  "body_html": "<p>Indulge in your love for reading with the Jeminise Personalized Reading Throw Blanket. This cozy and customizable blanket is the perfect companion for any bookworm, offering warmth and a unique way to express your passion for books. It's an ideal personalized gift for book lovers on any special occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Unique Gift for Book Lovers:</strong> A thoughtful and personal present that celebrates the joy of reading, perfect for any book enthusiast.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Customizable Design:</strong> Make this blanket truly one-of-a-kind by adding personal details such as skin color, hairstyle, and name.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), and X-Large (80x60 inches) for the perfect fit.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Thoughtful Gift Idea:</strong> An ideal gift for birthdays, Christmas, or as a heartfelt surprise for a fellow reader.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Comfort and Style:</strong> A beautifully designed, personalized throw blanket that brings both warmth and a touch of literary style to any reading nook.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from soft and durable Polyester with a lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> This blanket is conveniently machine washable for simple maintenance.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fill Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Book Lover Blanket 2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Modern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Book</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Blanket Form</th>\n<td>Throw Blanket</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Small (40x30 inches), Medium (50x40 inches), Large (60x50 inches), X-Large (80x60 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Medium</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Dimensions</th>\n<td>60\"L x 50\"W</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Lightweight</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
